_model: proposition
---
title: Proposition 30
---
order: 30
---
short_label: IX.30
---
statement: If an odd number measures an even number, then it also measures half of it.
---
proof:

Let the odd number *A* measure the even number *B.*

I say that it also measures the half of it.

<figure class="diagram">
<canvas id="canvas_0" width="230" height="140" tabindex="0"></canvas>
<noscript><img alt="IX.30 diagram" src="propIX30.gif"/></noscript>
<script type="text/javascript">
    geomlib.init({
        canvasid: "canvas_0",
        background: "35,19,100",
        title: "IX.30",
        elements: [
            "A0;point;free;-1000,40;0;0",
            "A3;point;free;1000,40;0;0",
            "B0;point;free;-1000,75;0;0",
            "B3;point;free;1000,75;0;0",
            "C0;point;free;-1000,110;0;0",
            "C3;point;free;1000,110;0;0",
            "U1;point;free;1000,0;0;0",
            "U2;point;free;1000,35;0;0",
            "A1;point;lineSlider;A0,A3,30,0;0",
            "A2;point;lineSlider;A0,A3,90,0;0",
            "A;line;connect;A1,A2;black",
            "B1;point;lineSlider;B0,B3,30,0;0",
            "B2;point;lineSlider;B0,B3,200,0;0",
            "B;line;connect;B1,B2;black",
            "C1;point;lineSlider;C0,C3,30,0;0",
            "C2;point;proportion;A1,A2,B1,B2,U1,U2,C1,C3;0",
            "C;line;connect;C1,C2;black"
        ],
    });
</script>
</figure>

Since *A* measures *B,* let it measure it according to *C.*

I say that *C* is not odd.

If possible, let it be so. Then, since *A* measures *B* according to *C,* therefore *A* multiplied by *C* makes *B.* Therefore *B* is made up of odd numbers the multitude of which is odd. Therefore *B* is odd, which is absurd, for by hypothesis it is even. Therefore *C* is not odd, therefore *C* is even. [!just IX.23]

Thus *A* measures *B* an even number of times. For this reason then it also measures the half of it.

Therefore, *if an odd number measures an even number, then it also measures half of it.*

<div class="qed">Q.E.D.</div>
---
body:

This proposition is used in the next one.
